Don't build the test-client suite.

The tests are not shipped, and they would link with this build's global link
flags, which breaks the static link on cross targets. Upstream skips the
directory only on Windows; cosmo presents as non-Windows at build time.

--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -756,10 +756,6 @@
 
 subdir('hw')
 
-if host_machine.system() != 'windows'
-    subdir('test')
-endif
-
 install_man(configure_file(
     input: 'man/Xserver.man',
     output: 'Xserver.1',
